UnfinishedB</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:GOB_LetterToZrell_UnfinishedB\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:GOB_LetterToZrell_UnfinishedB\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In the shrine behind the waterfall under the <a href=\"/wiki/Goblin_Camp\" title=\"Goblin Camp\">Goblin Camp</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-133&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;398</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[A scrap of paper containing what appear to be ideas for a love letter.]\n</p><p><br>\nCan't compare <a href=\"/wiki/Minthara\" title=\"Minthara\">her</a> to the moon or the stars or any of that rubbish because she lives underground... she ain't got any scabs or boils so can't compliment the best ones... might think i'm too small, tell her I'll buy a footstool for when we're kissin'... put some dead spiders in my hair next time i see her... probably just send her some bits of people wot I killed...\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>See also:\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Parchment_(Goblin_Camp)\" title=\"Parchment (Goblin Camp)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Book_Note_N_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Note_N_Item_Ico